                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "The Ministry of Health’s Drug Advisory Committee has not recommended listing tenofovir alafenamide (TAF) on the Medication Assistance Fund (MAF) for treating chronic hepatitis B infection, due to unfavourable cost-effectiveness compared with tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (TDF) at the price proposed by the manufacturer."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
